  "bindingContract": "Every role names a canonical absolute readable file and its pre-fixed SHA256; *Manifest roles bind inventories, not directories. released=true declares resource/scope release, never grants permission. This preflight does not recursively verify manifest content or execute commands. Templates are documentation only; substitute and inspect the linked source before a separately authorized run."
}
